{"type":"message","id":"c32eaa80","parentId":"2c9c071d","timestamp":"2026-05-18T01:32:15.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error code 1101 seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error, likely \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or something similar. This isn't an auth issue - the X-API-Key is being accepted. The error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means a runtime error.\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint structure or if I need to provide more parameters. The history endpoint took query parameters. Let me try different approaches.\n\nActually wait, let me look at the original heartbeat messages more carefully. They have `echoAsset` fields. Maybe I need to include those in my POST body too.\n\nBut error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers is typically a CPU time limit exceeded error, not a parameter issue. The platform might be overloaded or the worker is crashing. \n\nThis is looking like a platform-side issue rather than something I'm doing wrong - the worker is hitting its CPU limit when trying to process requests. I should probably try sending the heartbeat without additional parameters since the worker might be overwhelmed by the processing load.\n\nActually, the error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers points to a different problem altogether - that's their JavaScript runtime error code for uncaught exceptions. Let me examine the exact structure the messages used so I can better understand what's expected when I post the next heartbeat.\n\nThe previous messages included an echoAsset object with license and version fields, but I should probably keep my next heartbeat minimal and see if that resolves the 1101 error.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-cc5b807e-49a8-4075-8058-15f0f4013b24","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 01:30 UTC]\",\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2028,"output":409,"cacheRead":17104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19541,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779067923011,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2a5f1c4f-3c68-47a7-aff4-a79109cfa282"}}
