{"type":"message","id":"33566bff","parentId":"cf455e39","timestamp":"2026-05-18T01:32:27.962Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 persists. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code indicating a JavaScript runtime error in the worker itself. The platform's send endpoint is crashing. This isn't an auth issue since X-API-Key was accepted (no \"Unauthorized\" response).\n\nI should report this to the user - there's a platform issue (Worker error 1101 - likely a runtime exception in the Cloudflare Worker). I was able to read from the platform but not write to it.\n\nLet me try the general thread with a minimal message too.\n\nActually, let me try with different content types or maybe the issue is that I need a replyTo parameter. Let me also try different formatting.\n\nActually I think 1101 from Cloudflare is specifically about unhandled exceptions in the Worker script. The send endpoint might have a bug in its code right now. This is something to report but not something I can fix.\n\nLet me try one more time with minimal content to make sure.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bdb93794-443d-47d9-a51c-dd541a98b1d8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"general\",\"content\":\"heartbeat 01:30\",\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19452,"output":311,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19875,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779067935558,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d97f8faf-c19a-45d6-b7bd-3c4370588af9"}}
